discobsd-host (1.0.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * discobsd-term: Ctrl-] is a telnet-style escape (q quits, _ leaves the
    V6 emulator, d sends DEL, backslash sends Ctrl-backslash).
  * discobsd-web: key bar gains the V6 keys (DEL, Ctrl-backslash, Ctrl-_)
    and a Disconnect button that frees the console for the next session.

